{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo band-photo-text qr-hero"><img src="/images/2021/08/1mls-2-hero.webp" alt="Kitchen with a long island, white stools and a mosaic range wall" width="1024" height="683" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"><div class="wrap"><h2>Quick Refresh</h2></div></section><section class="band qr-intro"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h1>Great Spaces Start Here.</h1><div class="el-text"><p>Sometimes refreshing your space doesn't require a full renovation. A new countertop, a fresh vanity, a better-functioning laundry room, small changes that can make a big difference.</p></div><div class="el-text"><p>While we do a lot of full renovation projects, we also believe that sometimes smaller updates are exactly what’s needed. Whatever you’re thinking about changing, Singer Kitchens has been helping homeowners make confident decisions since 1928. Let us help you think it through.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-green" href="/request-consultation/">Let&#x27;s Talk Kitchens</a></p></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2026/05/refresh-page-photo.webp" alt="White and navy kitchen with a black range" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="band qr-what"><div class="wrap"><h2>What Is a Quick Refresh?</h2><div class="el-text qr-lede"><p>A Quick Refresh is a smaller-scale update designed to improve the spaces you use every day without the time, cost or disruption of a full renovation. Whether it’s new cabinets, countertops, a vanity, pantry storage, closet or a laundry room update, we’ll help you choose solutions that fit your home, your needs and your budget. You get the same trusted Singer Kitchens guidance and quality materials.</p></div><div class="qr-grid"><a class="qr-card" href="/countertops/"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2025/07/09mls.webp" alt="Undermount sink in a white quartz countertop" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Kitchen Countertops</h3><p>New countertops can transform how your kitchen looks and feels. We'll help you choose the right material and finish.</p></span></a><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2024/11/05mls.webp" alt="Grey kitchen with a gold chandelier and an island cooktop" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Kitchen Islands</h3><p>Add prep space, extra seating and smarter storage with a new island designed for the way you live.</p></span></div><a class="qr-card" href="/cabinets/"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2021/05/050721a.webp" alt="Kitchen with grey cabinets and a white island" width="800" height="534" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Kitchen Cabinets</h3><p>Replace dated cabinets with a clean, updated look that feels brighter, more functional and better suited to your home.</p></span></a><a class="qr-card" href="/bathrooms/"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2026/05/refresh-page-photo-3-vanity.webp" alt="Wood bathroom vanity with a round mirror" width="1200" height="1800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Bathroom Vanities</h3><p>A new vanity is one of the fastest ways to update a bathroom. Come see the options in person and find a style that feels right for your home.</p></span></a><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2021/08/14mls-1.webp" alt="Laundry room with stacked storage above the washer and dryer" width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Laundry Rooms</h3><p>Functional cabinetry that keeps your laundry room organized and working the way it should.</p></span></div><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2025/09/06mls.webp" alt="Kitchen with pantry cabinets beside the refrigerator" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Pantries</h3><p>Replace dated cabinets and add storage solutions like pantry cabinets and rollout trays to make your kitchen feel more organized.</p></span></div><a class="qr-card" href="/bathrooms/"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2018/05/bath2.webp" alt="Floating vanity sink" width="620" height="830" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Bathrooms</h3><p>Countertops, cabinetry and vanity solutions for bathrooms that need a refresh.</p></span></a><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2025/09/02mls-1.webp" alt="Gentilly Bungalow kitchen project photo" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Rental Properties</h3><p>Quality updates designed to hold up to everyday use and help your property stand out. Fast turnaround planned around your timeline.</p></span></div><a class="qr-card" href="/closets/"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2021/04/Closet_Slider6.webp" alt="Closets &amp; Home Organization Solutions" width="620" height="510" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Closets</h3><p>Need more out of a closet space? We’ll help you design a storage solution that makes better use of every inch.</p></span></a></div></div></section><section class="band qr-smaller"><div class="wrap"><h2>Smaller Updates. Thoughtfully Planned.</h2><div class="el-text qr-lede"><p>Singer Kitchens has been helping homeowners improve spaces in their homes since 1928. While we’re known for full renovations, sometimes a smaller project is exactly what’s needed. Whether you’re replacing cabinets, updating countertops, adding storage or refreshing a bathroom, closet or laundry room, our team can help you find thoughtful solutions that make sense for your space, your needs, and your budget. Call us or request an appointment to talk through your project with a designer and explore the options that make the most sense for your home.</p></div><div class="qr-grid qr-feat"><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2023/02/IMG_0260.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1000" height="666" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Quality You Can See</h3></span></div><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2023/02/IMG_0261.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1000" height="666" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Quick Turnaround</h3></span></div><div class="qr-card"><span class="qr-card-img"><img src="/images/2023/02/IMG_0257.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1000" height="666" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="qr-card-body"><h3>Trusted Since 1928</h3></span></div></div></div></section>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/process-strip.njk" %}{% raw %}<section class="band qr-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Not Sure If a Quick Refresh Is Right for You?</h2><div class="el-text qr-lede"><p>That’s what we’re here for. Sometimes a quick conversation is all it takes to decide whether a simple update or a full renovation makes the most sense. Our designers will give you honest guidance focused on what’s right for your home.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-green" href="/request-consultation/">Schedule a Design Conversation</a></p></div></section>{% endraw %}
